<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus invites tenders for 18,000 tonnes of maize.</title>
<headline>Cyprus invites tenders for 18,000 tonnes of maize.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission on Wednesday invited offers for the supply of one cargo of 18,000 tonnes of maize with shipment scheduled for January 1997.</p>
<p>Tenders close on Tuesday, December 10, the commission said in a statement.</p>
</text>
